<section class="noc-wrap noc-section--hero">
  <p class="noc-eyebrow noc-eyebrow--head">Services</p>
  <h1 class="noc-h1">Three ways to work together. Prices in the open.</h1>
  <p class="noc-lead noc-hero-lead">Every project is quoted after a conversation, but the starting points are below so you know before you write.</p>
</section>

<section class="noc-rule-top">
  <div class="noc-wrap">
    <div class="noc-service">
      <div>
        <span class="noc-num noc-service__num">01</span>
        <h2>Visual identity</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="noc-service__body">
        <p>A mark, a type system and a palette, drawn for one brand and documented so other people can use them without asking you. Built to survive an avatar, a jersey and a print run.</p>
        <div class="noc-list">
          <div class="noc-list__item"><span class="noc-list__num">01</span>Wordmark, monogram and glyph states</div>
          <div class="noc-list__item"><span class="noc-list__num">02</span>Type and colour system, one accent</div>
          <div class="noc-list__item"><span class="noc-list__num">03</span>Usage guidelines with minimum sizes</div>
          <div class="noc-list__item"><span class="noc-list__num">04</span>Export pack for web, print and social</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span class="noc-kicker noc-price__label">From</span>
        <p class="noc-price">600 €</p>
        <p class="noc-price__note">3 to 5 weeks</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="noc-service noc-reveal">
      <div>
        <span class="noc-num noc-service__num">02</span>
        <h2>Website</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="noc-service__body">
        <p>A static site, designed and built from a blank page. No page builder, no theme, no dashboard to learn. It loads fast because there is nothing in it that does not need to be there.</p>
        <div class="noc-list">
          <div class="noc-list__item"><span class="noc-list__num">01</span>Design and build, desktop and mobile</div>
          <div class="noc-list__item"><span class="noc-list__num">02</span>Content structure written with you</div>
          <div class="noc-list__item"><span class="noc-list__num">03</span>Static output, no build step to maintain</div>
          <div class="noc-list__item"><span class="noc-list__num">04</span>Handover, or hosting handled here</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span class="noc-kicker noc-price__label">From</span>
        <p class="noc-price">1 500 €</p>
        <p class="noc-price__note">4 to 10 weeks</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="noc-service noc-reveal">
      <div>
        <span class="noc-num noc-service__num">03</span>
        <h2>Hosting</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="noc-service__body">
        <p>The site stays where it was built, served as static files with the domain, the certificate and the backups handled. You get one contact for the site and the server, not two.</p>
        <div class="noc-list">
          <div class="noc-list__item"><span class="noc-list__num">01</span>Domain, DNS and certificate</div>
          <div class="noc-list__item"><span class="noc-list__num">02</span>Deploys and backups</div>
          <div class="noc-list__item"><span class="noc-list__num">03</span>Content edits on request</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span class="noc-kicker noc-price__label">Price</span>
        <p class="noc-price noc-price--sm">Quoted with the site</p>
        <p class="noc-price__note">Monthly, cancel any time</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="noc-wrap noc-section noc-split noc-reveal">
  <h2 class="noc-label">What is always included</h2>
  <div class="noc-included">
    <div>
      <h3 class="noc-h4">Zero templates</h3>
      <p class="noc-body">Nothing is reused between projects, at any price.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3 class="noc-h4">One interlocutor</h3>
      <p class="noc-body">The person who answers your message is the person doing the work.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3 class="noc-h4">Revisions until you sign off</h3>
      <p class="noc-body">No round counter. The project ends when it is right.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3 class="noc-h4">Files you own</h3>
      <p class="noc-body">Sources handed over at the end, in editable formats.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="noc-rule-top noc-reveal">
  <div class="noc-wrap noc-section noc-cta">
    <div>
      <h2 class="noc-h2">Not sure which one you need?</h2>
      <p>Describe the project in a few lines and you get an honest answer, including when the answer is that you do not need me yet.</p>
